---
# Tests only. unchecked-optional-access: every access follows a gtest ASSERT_TRUE/ASSERT_NE on the
# optional, which returns from the test when it fails, but the checker does not model ASSERT_*.
# cert-err58-cpp: static test constants; an exception while building one fails the test binary
# at startup, which is the right outcome. performance-inefficient-vector-operation: test setup
# loops, where speed is irrelevant.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -bugprone-unchecked-optional-access,
  -cert-err58-cpp,
  -performance-inefficient-vector-operation
